cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "IPBES TCA-Nexus approaches-actions linking pipeline"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: >-
  R targets pipeline behind the approaches x actions analysis of the IPBES
  Transformative Change / Nexus article: an OpenAlex corpus built over the two
  IPBES Zotero groups, regex-based extraction of definition citations, and 
  BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 embeddings, producing the approaches x actions heat map.
